---
title: "initialize (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate tokenPrice > 0
    q_validate_params --> q_validate_timing: validate bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_validate_timing --> q_validate_timing2: validate prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime
    q_validate_timing2 --> q_validate_timing3: validate prefundEndTime <= startTime
    q_validate_timing3 --> q_validate_timing4: validate startTime < endTime
    q_validate_timing4 --> q_validate_timing5: validate endTime < refundEndTime
    q_validate_timing5 --> q_validate_invest: validate minimumInvestAmount > 0
    q_validate_invest --> q_set_config: set tokenPrice, bidToken, askToken
    q_set_config --> q_set_timing: set prefundStartTime, prefundEndTime, startTime, endTime, refundEndTime
    q_set_timing --> q_set_addresses: set projectAdmin, addressRegistry
    q_set_addresses --> q_set_fees: set legionFee, referrerFee bps values
    q_set_fees --> [*]: emit Initialized

    note right of q_validate_params
        INV-001: tokenPrice must be greater than zero
        INV-002: all address parameters must be non-zero
    end note

    note right of q_validate_timing
        INV-003: prefundStartTime < prefundEndTime <= startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-004: prefund duration between 1 hour and 12 weeks
        INV-005: active sale duration between 1 hour and 12 weeks
        INV-006: refund period between 1 hour and 2 weeks
    end note
